  <meta slot="head" name="nlp-entities" content="chronotype, circadian rhythm, PER3, CRY1, CLOCK genes, Munich ChronoType Questionnaire, MCTQ, social jet lag, morningness, eveningness, genome-wide association study, suprachiasmatic nucleus, sleep-wake timing, melatonin, cortisol, synchrony effect" />
